  "query_preview": "..\n(Tomorrow through Friday)\nIssued at 1055 AM CDT Fri Aug 14 2026\n\nThe forecast trends remain unchanged with the large upper-level\nhigh over the region shifting westward a bit and flattening so\nthat one or more upper-level disturbances can brush the area late\nSunday and Monday. Depending on storm coverage and associated \nclouds, temperatures ahead of the front on Sunday could get\nback near the highest readings of this heat wave before moderating\na bit with the front and some extra clouds. Any reduction in\ntemperature with the front will be offset some by an increase in\nhumidity.    \n\nThe heat is expected to build again starting on Tuesday. There\nis still no strong signal for a major change to our weather pattern\nthrough the middle of next week.",
